From 2e6a82dc14b9d7a74659248ae340f72cadf6f4d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 10:15:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] R07: reuse prepared city network for closures (overlay
 adjacency, bounded LRU)

Closures no longer rebuild the 94k-edge index: base adjacency is built once per
(access, direction) and closed edges are removed via a small per-node overlay.
Results are byte-identical (citywide result_digest fd80debd...); compare on the
city case drops from ~1.7 s to 0.47 s (first) / 0.13-0.22 s (repeated edits).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
